SUMMARY:Prove What Your Agent Did
DESCRIPTION:All Things AI (Live)\nMost agent governance answers stop at "h
 ere are our logs". A counterparty who does not work for you has no particu
 lar reason to accept that\, and those are the people asking. The TRACE Reg
 istry is a public append-only record of agent evidence\, with signed check
 points\, an offline verifier\, and a page stating what it does and does no
 t prove. Action State runs a free public witness: any log can send it a ch
 eckpoint\, a few hundred bytes carrying no payload\, and get back a receip
 t anyone can verify without calling either company. On September 7 the reg
 istry sent a checkpoint to a witness operated by a company it does not own
 \, and the receipt verified from published bytes using a public key and op
 en source code\, with no network calls. We will run that verification live
 \, including the two fields the receipt deliberately leaves false\, and Ma
 rk will take questions.
